#. i18n: file: ktorrent/pref/advancedpref.ui:216
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QSpinBox, kcfg_previewSizeVideo)
#: rc.cpp:586
msgid ""
"<p>The amount of data at the beginning and end of a video file, which will "
