#. i18n: file: ktorrent/pref/generalpref.ui:146
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_suppressSleep)
#: rc.cpp:739
msgid ""
"Prevent computer from going into a sleep state when torrents are running."
msgstr ""
